; Nolang doc catalog: en
; Source-comment translations, keyed by the anchor an author wrote in a
; trailing `[label](#anchor)` line. New keys are SEEDED from the comment text
; by `make i18n`; an existing value is preserved, so this file is meant to be
; edited by hand. Every key must still exist in some .no source, or the gate
; rejects it as an orphan.
{
  'args.count': `
count: number of arguments, including the program name
delegates to the os.args() builtin, which returns the whole argv vector; the length of that vector is the count
`
  'args.get': `
get: the i-th argument
delegates to the os.arg(i) builtin, which reads argv[i] of main; an out-of-range i returns nil
`
  'args.program': 'program: the program name (argument 0)'
}
